{
  "id": "actions_ats3089",
  "name": "炬芯科技 ATS3089C 智能穿戴眼镜 BLE协议",
  "vendor": {
    "vendorName": "Actions Technology (炬芯科技)",
    "chipSeries": "ATS3089C / ATW6095 系列",
    "protocolVersion": "v1.0",
    "website": "https://www.actionstech.com",
    "description": "炬芯科技 ATS3089C 是双模蓝牙6.0单芯片智能穿戴SoC，采用MCU(MStar@202MHz) + DSP(@202MHz)双核架构。支持蓝牙双模(BR/EDR+BLE)、LE Audio(LC3)、AI ENC降噪。内置2D+2.5D GPU(JPEG Decoder)、QSPI/CPU8080/SPI显示接口。适用于智能眼镜、智能手表等。ATW6095为升级版，内置Cadence HIFI5@420MHz DSP + 100GOPS@INT8 CIM NPU。BR+BLE双连接功耗<100μA@500ms，MCU功耗12μA/MHz@3.8V。炬芯在Halliday AI眼镜项目上已量产。"
  },
